    <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="precedence__table_8h_1a8a73a844271122d98ae7d995ce8d3e16" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>size_t</type>
        <definition>size_t precedence_table_index</definition>
        <argsstring>(TokenType terminal, int line)</argsstring>
        <name>precedence_table_index</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="token_8h_1aa520fbf142ba1e7e659590c07da31921" kindref="member">TokenType</ref></type>
          <declname>terminal</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>line</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Vrati index terminalu do precedencni tabulky. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Nejprve overi token funkci token_type_validate (neplatny typ je interni chyba). Terminaly mezi TOKEN_LL_TERM_COUNT a TOKEN_EXPR_TERM_DELIMITER dostanou index vypoctem z jejich hodnoty v enumu a zabiraji souvisly rozsah od 0. Ostatni terminaly precedencni tabulky, ktere jsou v enumu TokenType mezi indexatory LL tabulky (napr. zavorky), dostanou index za timto rozsahem. <ref refid="structToken" kindref="compound">Token</ref>, ktery precedencni tabulku neindexuje, zpusobi interni chybu (ERR_INTERNAL).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>terminal</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Typ terminalu. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>line</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Cislo radku pro chybova hlaseni, &lt;= 0 pokud neni znam. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Index v rozsahu 0 az PRECEDENCE_TABLE_SIZE - 1. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="src/precedence_table.h" line="137" column="8" bodyfile="src/precedence_table.c" bodystart="284" bodyend="296" declfile="src/precedence_table.h" declline="137" declcolumn="8"/>
      </memberdef>
      <memberdef kind="function" id="precedence__table_8h_1abb2b191e7dc60a6b806014ce7fbd97fe" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="precedence__table_8h_1ad29641fd0f43eb518a1f9cbfeb6f16df" kindref="member">PrecedenceDirective</ref></type>
        <definition>PrecedenceDirective precedence_table_lookup</definition>
        <argsstring>(TokenType stack_terminal, TokenType input_terminal, int line)</argsstring>
        <name>precedence_table_lookup</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="token_8h_1aa520fbf142ba1e7e659590c07da31921" kindref="member">TokenType</ref></type>
          <declname>stack_terminal</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="token_8h_1aa520fbf142ba1e7e659590c07da31921" kindref="member">TokenType</ref></type>
          <declname>input_terminal</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>line</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Vyhleda direktivu v precedencni tabulce. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Zaindexuje tabulku terminalem na zasobniku (ten je vzdy indexem tabulky, jinak jde o internich chybu) a terminalem na vstupu. Vstupni terminal, ktery precedencni tabulku neindexuje, je chyba ve vstupnim programu a program skonci syntaktickou chybou (ERR_SYNTAX). Pokud je pole tabulky prazdne (DIRECTIVE_ERROR), kombinace terminalu neni platna a program skonci take syntaktickou chybou (ERR_SYNTAX) s vypisem pouzitych indexu.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stack_terminal</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Terminal na zasobniku (radek tabulky). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>input_terminal</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Terminal na vstupu (sloupec tabulky). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>line</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Cislo radku vstupniho tokenu pro chybova hlaseni. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Direktiva, ktera neni DIRECTIVE_ERROR. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
